#!/unix
* The kernel calls that the clang-retro AIX C library uses, for xcoff-ld
* (-bI:unix.exp). They are a subset of AIX's /lib/syscalls.exp; the system
* loader binds them by name when a program starts.
_exit syscall
_getpid syscall
accessx syscall
chdir syscall
close syscall
fstatx syscall
gettimer syscall
kill syscall
kioctl syscall
klseek syscall
kopen syscall
kread syscall
kwrite syscall
mkdir syscall
rename syscall
rmdir syscall
statx syscall
unlink syscall
